{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>ידעתי כי טרם</b> you send us <b>תיראון</b> — that is, upon you [will come] fear and great dread greater than now. Another interpretation: <b>ידעתי כי טרם תיראון</b> — you are not yet fearful, for the wheat and the spelt were not struck, and you still have to eat."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The bracketed [תבא] appears in the source; I rendered it as 'will come' though it is editorially supplied."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:48.036304315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}